<http://data.silknow.org/object/ce29b568-96d9-3a7e-8b36-716d71262534/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Two-part silver pendant, consisting of a shuttle-shaped pendant hanging from a stylised crown.  The pendant is made of glass enclosing a spray of flowers made from silk, in a frame set with red and white pastes in closed settings.  The crown is set with red and white pastes and is gilded and engraved on the back.  There is a hook for suspension on the back of the crown."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/ce29b568-96d9-3a7e-8b36-716d71262534> .

